<code>assert \forall int i; index <= i && i < \old(this.size()); (\old(this.get(i)) == null && this.get(i + 1) == null) || this.get(i + 1) == \old(this.get(i));</code>

This assertion ensures that for every valid index `i` starting from the given `index` up to the old size of the list, the element at the next position `i + 1` is either `null` when the old element at `i` is `null`, or the element at `i + 1` equals the old element at `i`.
